# Built-in display UI resolution (More Space). macconfig-check.sh compares the
# built-in panel's `_spdisplays_resolution` and warns when it does not start
# with this prefix. No built-in panel (clamshell, external display only) is an
# info skip. Read-only: no displayplacer, and --fix never changes the mode.
#
# This Color LCD is spdisplays_3024x1964Retina (_spdisplays_pixels 3600 x 2338).
# More Space on that panel is the scaled mode 1800 x 1169.
# Format: builtin | prefix
builtin|1800 x 1169
